    <elementInformations>
        <elementInformation name="description" show="1">A compact energy meter with flat terminals designed to monitor either a three-phase system or three independent single-phase circuits. It seamlessly integrates into smart home systems or professional setups, providing accurate, real-time data to optimize energy efficiency.</elementInformation>
